    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the toga of a Roman governor and build your own ancient empire from the ground up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Antiquitas is a historical city-building simulation from the creator of My Colony, set in the golden age of Rome. Grow your civilization from a humble village into a mighty empire, managing resources, citizens, and trade across expansive ancient landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Build anytime, anywhere - no connection required!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Resource production and trade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Full colony simulation \u2013 housing, jobs, education, entertainment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Deep tech tree spanning Roman innovation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Trade and interact with other players online (optional)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re a seasoned city-builder or new to the genre, Antiquitas offers a rewarding and relaxing empire management experience with no time limits or paywalls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin your rise to glory today!</p>",
